K114s camera row for the aura v1.0.0b15 loader (the configured Stage 2 loader since 2026-11-24).

The same row as patches/aura/camera/0001 ({"apple,k114s", 0xba, V27_2} in t6050_isp_boards), placed for
aura v1.0.0b15, where the comment hunk of 0001 no longer applies. Build: copy the b15 source, apply this with
`patch -p1`, then RELEASE=1 CHAINLOADING=1 ESP_STAGE2=1 USE_CLANG=1 with the Omarchy logo and AURA_VERSION_TAG=v1.0.0b15, as
the omacom aura recipe does. Result on 2026-11-24: 3,932,160 bytes, sha256 06b38fd09a9a669ca0a21e500bd6fc6a7ae8f443981dbeed6aab10f0a5c25c4d.

